            /** @description Events: changed (data: {}) and replaced (data: {}). The stream sends one changed at its start. After changed, read the screen again: getMe, the instances and /healthz. After replaced, close the stream and do not connect again immediately: a newer stream of the same user took its place. A comment line ": ping" comes every 15 seconds. The stream ends with no event when the access of the login ends or the server stops. */
